spice
* SPICE Netlist
* NMOS M1 (Drain Gate Source)
M1 Vout Vb2 3 NMOS

* PMOS M2 (Drain Gate Source)
M2 Vout Vout VDD PMOS

* Current Source I1
I1 VDD Vout DC

* Current Source Iin (Zin in diagram)
Iin 3 0 DC

* Resistor RS
RS Vin 3 Rvalue

* Voltage Source for VDD
VDD 4 0 DC

* Other necessary commands
.options ... (specify simulation options as needed)
.end